ably gone, but dates his last commit to about 2021 where the truth is 2023. Sam Okafor is listed as a fallback reviewer.\", \"pass\": false}, {\"n\": 2, \"reason\": \"Gives MikeWang 101 of 117 lines, which is 86%. It credits Mei Chen with 11 lines and Ravi with 2 lines. Mei's Time7 authorship and the committer split are not described.\", \"pass\": true}, {\"n\": 3, \"reason\": \"Follows the rename to database_sql.go. It names Justin Overfelt at 26 lines, with Stone, Wheeler and Souza, and says all left. Ravi is credited only with the rename.\", \"pass\": true}, {\"n\": 4, \"reason\": \"Does not give the repo-wide 95.9%. It treats Rowe as split across three identities, merging them only as a suggestion, and says nobody is active under a 90-day test.\", \"pass\": false}, {\"n\": 5, \"reason\": \"Names Sam Okafor as a fallback reviewer, which fails.\", \"pass\": false}], \"F\": [{\"n\": 1, \"reason\": \"Names Paul Borman with 73.0% of time.go (111 of 152) and says he is no longer active. His last commit is given as 2016, though the truth is 2023. The share is correct and the departure is stated. Sam Okafor is given no lines.\", \"pass\": true}, {\"n\": 2, \"reason\": \"Credits MikeWang with 81.2% of version7.go. Mei Chen is credited with the Time7 patch at 9.4%, committed by Ravi. Ravi holds only 2 lines.\", \"pass\": true}, {\"n\": 3, \"reason\": \"Follows database_sql.go back through sql.go. It names Justin Overfelt at 44.1%, with Stone, Wheeler and Souza, and says all are inactive.\", \"pass\": true}, {\"n\": 4, \"reason\": \"Says 95.7% of non-blank lines belong to people with no recent commit, which is in the 93-98% range. It gives time.go and version7.go no meaningful active share, and SQL 0%. It names Alex Rowe as active. It also lists Mei Chen as active, which is wrong, and it names a 365-day window with Alexander Rowe called inactive for time.go. It does not name Ravi and Kofi as active people in the list.\", \"pass\": false}, {\"n\": 5, \"reason\": \"Says Sam 